'  rival.script from the cut, taken up from the start screen in a new process.
' Nothing on the command line and nothing on the screen says which mode this
' is: the rules, the difficulty, the opponent and the scenario all come out of
' the file.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 163,27         ' LOAD
mapclick 150,318         ' walk in, where their man holds the place
wait 120
fight                    ' speak or fight, and this is a fight
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
save                     ' and what fourteen blows with a knife come to
